# Gap registers, review notes, probe output, and scanner reports have no patterns
# here on purpose. They live outside the project directory entirely, on the
# machine that produced them, per references/operating-discipline.md.

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
.envrc
*.env

